#! kernel test
#! sd-theme example
# The UI demo in the SD theme themes/example (tests/kernel/ui_demo.c, with R
# held too): its colours, its wallpaper beside the list (a layout patch gives
# the list margins), and a dialog over it with the theme's dim and slide.
-k 1:L+SELECT+R
-w "screen ready: ui-demo"
-k @2:-
-s @4:list.png
-k @10:A -k @14:-
-w "screen ready: ui-dialog"
-s @30:dialog.png
